  <phrase title="option_explain.knownbotsEmailUserAgents" version_id="5010070" version_string="5.1.0"><![CDATA[Enable this option to periodically email user agent strings that were stored in the database to the specified email address. This option only has effect if the "Store user agents in database" option is also enabled. Leave blank to send emails to the admin email address.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.knownbotsFetchNewBots" version_id="5000032" version_string="5.0.0 Beta 2"><![CDATA[Turn on to automatically fetch new bot identifiers from the KnownBots API set up by the addon author. If you disable this option, you must set up your own system to update the known bots definitions - see the addon FAQ for instructions.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.knownbotsSendUserAgents" version_id="5010070" version_string="5.1.0"><![CDATA[Enable to send detected user agents via API for further analysis. This option only has effect if the "Store user agents in database" option is also enabled.]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.knownbotsShowBotStats" version_id="2040070" version_string="2.4.0"><![CDATA[Turn on to show robot statistics in the sidebar widgets]]></phrase>
  <phrase title="option_explain.knownbotsStoreUserAgents" version_id="5000032" version_string="5.0.0 Beta 2"><![CDATA[Enable to store unknown and bot user agents in the database for further analysis. Choose how long to retain user agent records before being automatically purged. Set days to zero to never purge user agent records (not recommended).]]></phrase>
